WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.791
Bird and Kip went to the boardwalk.

2
00:00:08.792 --> 00:00:15.006
"Even the boardwalk is hot!" said Bird.

3
00:00:15.007 --> 00:00:18.959
"Let's look in the trash cans," said Kip.

4
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:32.793
"Maybe we'll find cups with ice."

5
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:39.220
Bird and Kip looked in the trash cans.

6
00:00:39.221 --> 00:00:59.159
They looked near the pizza place.

7
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:08.533
They looked near the hot dog place.

8
00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.711
There was no ice.

9
00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:18.584
But Kip saw something else.

10
00:01:18.585 --> 00:01:32.732
"Ice cream!"

11
00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:36.283
"Forget it, Kip," said Bird.

12
00:01:36.284 --> 00:01:41.409
"The ice cream is just for people."

13
00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.512
Suddenly . . . Plop!

14
00:01:44.513 --> 00:01:47.818
The ice cream cone landed next to them.

15
00:01:47.819 --> 00:01:51.100
"My ice cream cone!" cried the boy.

16
00:01:51.101 --> 00:02:00.191
"I'll get you another one," said his mom.

17
00:02:00.192 --> 00:02:05.177
Kip stuck his face in the ice cream.

18
00:02:05.178 --> 00:02:11.698
"Brr!" he said.

19
00:02:11.699 --> 00:02:15.113
Bird stuck her face in the ice cream.

20
00:02:15.114 --> 00:02:19.161
"Brr!" she said.

21
00:02:19.162 --> 00:02:22.371
The friends laughed and laughed.

22
00:02:22.372 --> 00:02:26.720
At last they were cool.

